From cc90aacfa02982acf2252891df4ab060a898403d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: clean-room <clean-room@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 16:40:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] feat(windows): deliver system toast notifications via
 uv + windows-toasts

Upstream stubs show_desktop_notification on Windows (Ok(false)), so
[ui.toast] delivery = "system" silently drops every notification for
Windows clients, including remote attach where the official Linux server
forwards NotifyKind::SystemToast to the foreground client.

Spawn 'uv run --no-project --with windows-toasts python -c <script>'
with a hidden console, fire-and-forget so a cold uv cache cannot stall
the client event loop. Title and body are passed as argv, never
interpolated into the Python code. A missing uv reports Ok(false),
matching a missing notify-send on Linux.
---
 src/platform/windows.rs | 112 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 110 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

